        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: J. F. Lawton, Shawn Levy, Garry Marshall, Richard Gere, Julia Roberts, Jason Alexander\n- Films: Pretty Woman, U R My Jaan\n- Roles: screenwriter, producer, director, actor\n- Topics: remakes, romance films\n\nFacts:\n- J. F. Lawton was born on August 11, 1960, and he is an American screenwriter, producer, and director.\n- Shawn Levy was born on July 23, 1968, and he is a Canadian film director, producer, and actor.\n- Pretty Woman is a 1990 American romantic comedy film directed by Garry Marshall from a screenplay by J. F. Lawton.\n- U R My Jaan is a Hindi romance film that remakes the 1990 film Pretty Woman.\n- U R My Jaan was released worldwide on September 23, 2011.\n- The source sentence states that Pretty Woman starred Richard Gere, Julia Roberts, and Jason Alexander.",
